    "386": {
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "edition": "Wednesday 28 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Fin Smith misses England training with calf injury ahead of Australia test",
          "body": "Fin Smith, pencilled in as England's starting No 10, is missing training with a calf injury, and the timing could hardly be worse for Steve Borthwick. The two leading midfield candidates for the Australia test, Seb Atkinson and Bernhard Janse van Rensburg, are also unable to train this week, while Bath flanker Guy Pepper limped off against Gloucester. Borthwick's November now has to deliver lasting answers as well as results."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa's Cheslin Kolbe set to miss rest of Nations Championship",
          "body": "Australia's Angus Crichton commits to NSW Waratahs after NRL switch. France's Galthié reshuffles Nations Championship squad after injuries. Wales release Rio Dyer from autumn squad with hamstring injury."
        }
      ],
