        "name": "Guardian Rugby Union"
      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "edition": "Wednesday 28 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury reshuffle",
          "heading": "Galthié reshuffles squad after injuries to Hastoy, Gazzotti and Brau-Boirie",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié has reshuffled his extended squad for the Nations Championship after Antoine Hastoy, Marko Gazzotti and Fabien Brau-Boirie picked up injuries in Top 14 action and will miss the resumption of the competition. Nicolas Depoortere, Anthony Jelonch and Louis Le Brun have been called up, and the Castres fly-half could win his first cap. Planet Rugby counts four withdrawals in all, on top of absences for Jalibert, Ramos and Marchand."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa's Cheslin Kolbe set to miss rest of Nations Championship",
