    "389": {
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "edition": "Wednesday 28 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Menoncello set to miss autumn Tests after Toulouse shoulder sprain",
          "body": "Italy's centre Tommaso Menoncello is set to miss the autumn Tests after a left shoulder sprain suffered for Toulouse, with the injury expected to keep him out for several weeks. He went off in the 43rd minute of Toulouse's 43-40 Champions Cup win over Exeter Chiefs. It is another setback for the 24-year-old, who joined Toulouse over the summer and had already been sidelined after an early-season injury. Gonzalo Quesada must prepare for the November campaign, starting against South Africa, without one of his key backs."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa's Cheslin Kolbe set to miss rest of Nations Championship",
