        {
          "kicker": "Squad change",
          "heading": "Macs Page called up as Rio Dyer ruled out of autumn",
          "body": "Rio Dyer has been released from the Wales squad with a hamstring injury picked up while scoring for the Dragons at Ospreys. The door opens for uncapped Scarlets wing Macs Page, who was left out of the original squad despite four tries in his first four matches. Page is in return-to-play protocols after a head injury against the Stormers, and Wales kicking coach Alex Davies said of Dyer: \"To be selected and then get an injury is tough.\""
        },
