          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thomas Gallo sidelined at least six months as Pumas make three changes",
          "body": "Felipe Contepomi's London mini-camp has been rebuilt after three injury-enforced changes. Prop Thomas Gallo dislocated his left wrist in Lyon's win at Bayonne and will be sidelined for at least six months after an operation; Dragons loosehead Rodrigo Martínez replaces him. Santiago Carreras, out with a knee injury, has been replaced by Mateo Soler. Santiago Chocobares, concussed, awaits the outcome of an HIA, with Matías Moroni on standby ahead of the Ireland opener."
        },
